variables is module
variables purpose "Show declaring, setting, and merging values"
variables path variables
variables imports standard.console
variables imports standard.math
variables exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParameter none
showInt input value Int64 copied
showInt output none
showInt outputOwnedBy none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memoryHeap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt let none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue argument value Int64 value copy
writeValue result none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError

choose is operation
choose purpose "Return 7 when asked to pick seven, else 10, through a value set on either branch"
choose invariant none
choose typeParameter none
choose input pick Bool copied
choose output Int64
choose outputOwnedBy none
choose raises none
choose effect none
choose uses none
choose memoryHeap false
choose async false
choose maxRecursion none
choose label begin loopKind none
choose label begin within none
choose label seven loopKind none
choose label seven within none
choose label other loopKind none
choose label other within none
choose label merged loopKind none
choose label merged within none
choose let sevenValue Int64 7 immutable
choose let ten Int64 10 immutable
choose let chosen Int64 unset mutable
choose at begin branch if pick goto seven else goto other
choose at seven set chosen sevenValue
choose at seven goto merged
choose at other set chosen ten
choose at other goto merged
choose at merged return ok chosen

scaled is operation
scaled purpose "Return a value from a local of the same name as one in main"
scaled invariant none
scaled typeParameter none
scaled input start Int64 copied
scaled output Int64
scaled outputOwnedBy none
scaled raises none
scaled effect none
scaled uses none
scaled memoryHeap false
scaled async false
scaled maxRecursion none
scaled label begin loopKind none
scaled label begin within none
scaled let three Int64 3 immutable
scaled at begin do triple
scaled at begin return ok tripled

triple is call
triple in scaled
triple invokes math.multiplyInt64
triple argument left Int64 start copy
triple argument right Int64 three copy
triple result tripled Int64
triple ownedBy none
triple cleanedBy none
triple borrows none
triple catch none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap false
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main let ten Int64 10 immutable
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let yes Bool true immutable
main let no Bool false immutable
main let three Int64 30 immutable
main let counter Int64 ten mutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main at begin do showStart
main at begin do bump
main at begin set counter bumped
main at begin do showBumped
main at begin do chooseSeven
main at begin do showSeven
main at begin do chooseTen
main at begin do showTen
main at begin do callScaled
main at begin do showScaled
main at begin do showThree
main at begin return ok okCode

